  "account": "林睿读书&书在橱窗",
  "source_title": "绍兴城址两千五百年没挪窝，赣州靠福寿沟九百年不涝，荆州城墙比长城最早的砖还早两百零七年，大理坐拥苍山洱海风花雪月，襄阳护城河最宽两百五十米叫华夏第一城池。从江南水乡到汉水之滨，这五座古城一座比一座狠#中国古城#历史古城 #旅行推荐 #365日走遍中国#历史文化",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 554.701995,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集，咱们盘了第十到第六浪中藏在山水里，丽江长在水上，徽州把城套在城里镇原守着太极图凤凰住在沱江上。好多朋友看完在评论区炒翻了，有人说绍兴呢赣州呢襄阳呢？别急，今天这集就是第五道第一，一座比一座狠。最后那个被叫做华夏第一城。上迟老规矩开讲之前，麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听。第五名，浙江绍兴古城在会稽山脚下越湖水边上。公元前四百九十年，越王勾践让大夫范蠡建城，到今天两千五百多年了。这城最绝的是他城址从来没挪过窝。两千五百年改朝换代多少回，他还在老地方跟他一样，老的只有苏州绍兴。城里有三座小山、釜山、杉杉塔山，三座山并立在城里浙东古运河穿城而过，八千多条河道六百多座桥有句老话叫，三山万户象盘曲，百桥、千阶水纵横。您想想，两千五百年了，河还是那条河桥，还是那座桥，人，还是住在老地方，这城不是建在地上，是长在地里的。王羲之在这写了兰亭序。陆游在这儿写下死去，元知万事空。鲁迅从这儿走出去，一座城把江南的骨和魂全泡在黄酒里了。第四名，江西赣州古城在江西南部张江和共江在城下汇合，汇成赣江三面环水。这城有两千两百多年历史，最绝的地方是他九百多年没被淹过。赣州三面都是水，北宋以前年年闹水患，北宋西宁年间知州刘怡修了一套地下排水系统，因为排水沟的走向像古篆体的福寿两个字，所以叫福寿沟。这套沟全长十二点六公里，利用赣州西南高东北低的地势，用明沟暗渠和池塘连成一张网。水大了，排走水小了，存住九百多年了，赣州再没被淹过，人称不落。浮城您去赣州看看，宋代城墙还在玉孤台还在辛弃疾写过玉孤台下清江水，中间多少行人泪站在城墙上，一边是张江，一边是共江两条江合在一起。这城站在两条江中间占了两千两百多年。第三名，湖北荆州古城在长江边上，楚国文化的发祥地两千八百多年了。这城最绝的是他的城墙。荆州古城墙是中国南方保存最完整的古城墙，城，高将近九米，周长十一公里多，绕城一周完整无缺。为什么修的这么结实？荆州是兵家必争之地，关羽在这镇守过李白，写过千里江陵一日还，就是这儿城墙外面是护城河，全长一万多米，宽三十米水深，四米系通太湖。嗯，东联长湖跟古运河连着。您想想，城里有东西长三公里多，南北宽一公里多，四面都是城墙，围着外面一圈水围着这城怎么打？最绝的是，城砖上还有文字，记录着烧砖的年代和工匠的名字，比万里长城上目前发现最早的砖还早。两百零七年第二名，云南大理古城在苍山脚下，洱海边上。明洪武十五年建的一千两百多年哪，这城最绝的是他的位置。东临洱海，西镇苍山、苍山十九峰十八西溪水从山上流下来，穿过古城。流径洱海整座城的布局是九街十八巷棋盘格局从南城门进去，抬头就能看见。苍山回头看就是洱海，古人把这叫风花雪月，下观风上观花、苍山雪洱海月，这四样东西全在这座城周围。古理在唐代是南赵国的都城，宋代是大理李国的都城，一座城做了五百多年的国都站在城墙上，左边是苍山，右边是洱海，这地方不是神仙住的地方是什么？我前阵子翻到一本叫三百六十五日走遍中国的日历书，左边一页是每个地方的实景大图，加一段五十来个字的冷知识，右边是日期纪事夜，什么季节去哪座小城，走哪条路，看什么风景最合适，都给你安排好了。不是那种千篇一律的景点介绍，是帮你挑日子。今天翻到镇原，明天翻到巍山，后天翻到阆中，翻到哪页，就觉得那个地方在喊你我自己的习惯是每天早起翻一页当个消遣，翻到一个从来没听说过的小地方，就去网上搜搜照片，搜完就想订票。我已经放下面了，点开就能看到。喜欢到处走走的朋友，弄一本放茶几，上一年下来，整个中国哪儿值得去，哪个乐去，心里全有谱了。第一名，湖北襄阳古城在汉水中游南岸，三面环水，一面靠山。这座城有两千八百多年历史，最绝的地方是他的护城河，平均宽度一百八十米，最宽的地方，两百五十米，相当于将近三个标准足球场连在一起。这是中国最宽的人工护城河。您想想，两百多米宽的水面，加上三面环水的天然地势，这城怎么打？历史上襄阳打过一百七十二次仗，最出名的一次，南宋守了六年，蒙古铁骑硬是没打下来。所以襄阳有个外号，叫铁打的襄阳华夏第一城池，城墙上现在还能走人，周长七千三百多米。站在临汉门城楼上，北面就是汉江。王维写过江流，天地外，山色有无中，就是站在襄阳城上看到的景。南面是国的山西，灭是万善，北面是汉江，东面是汉江的曲流山。把城围住，水，把城抱住，城就在山水中间两千多年来。不管怎么改朝换代，襄阳的山水格局没动过，汉江还在北边流一去，山还在南边站城还在中间一座城跟山水绑在一起，绑了两千多年，这才是真正做头把交椅的东西。不是城墙有多厚，是这城跟山水长在一起了，别的城修在山水旁边，襄阳是长在山水里面，您听出来了没有？这十座古城没有一座是靠楼高出名的，绍兴靠的是山围四面水绕三方。丽江靠的是没有城墙水穿城过徽州靠的是城套城镇，远靠的是太极图。阆中靠的是沱江吊脚楼。绍兴靠的是两千五百年不成窝。赣州靠的是九百年，不烙荆州，靠的是南方最完整的城墙。大理靠的是苍山洱海，襄阳靠的是华夏第一城池，每一座古城的厉害之处都不在楼有多高，在它跟山水过了一辈子，点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00001",
      "start_ms": 190,
      "end_ms": 710,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00002",
      "start_ms": 870,
      "end_ms": 5670,
      "text": "咱们盘了第十到第六浪中藏在山水里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00003",
      "start_ms": 6210,
      "end_ms": 7770,
      "text": "丽江长在水上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00004",
      "start_ms": 8010,
      "end_ms": 14710,
      "text": "徽州把城套在城里镇原守着太极图凤凰住在沱江上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00005",
      "start_ms": 15670,
      "end_ms": 18470,
      "text": "好多朋友看完在评论区炒翻了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00006",
      "start_ms": 18790,
      "end_ms": 22190,
      "text": "有人说绍兴呢赣州呢襄阳呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00007",
      "start_ms": 22350,
      "end_ms": 22850,
      "text": "别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00008",
      "start_ms": 23210,
      "end_ms": 25350,
      "text": "今天这集就是第五道第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00009",
      "start_ms": 25590,
      "end_ms": 26670,
      "text": "一座比一座狠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00010",
      "start_ms": 27050,
      "end_ms": 29810,
      "text": "最后那个被叫做华夏第一城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00011",
      "start_ms": 29810,
      "end_ms": 33460,
      "text": "上迟老规矩开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00012",
      "start_ms": 33820,
      "end_ms": 35980,
      "text": "麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00013",
      "start_ms": 36580,
      "end_ms": 38660,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00014",
      "start_ms": 38800,
      "end_ms": 39440,
      "text": "第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00015",
      "start_ms": 39760,
      "end_ms": 45320,
      "text": "浙江绍兴古城在会稽山脚下越湖水边上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00016",
      "start_ms": 46139,
      "end_ms": 48060,
      "text": "公元前四百九十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00017",
      "start_ms": 48460,
      "end_ms": 51900,
      "text": "越王勾践让大夫范蠡建城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00018",
      "start_ms": 52740,
      "end_ms": 55420,
      "text": "到今天两千五百多年了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00019",
      "start_ms": 55900,
      "end_ms": 59735,
      "text": "这城最绝的是他城址从来没挪过窝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00020",
      "start_ms": 60670,
      "end_ms": 63745,
      "text": "两千五百年改朝换代多少回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00021",
      "start_ms": 64510,
      "end_ms": 67220,
      "text": "他还在老地方跟他一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00022",
      "start_ms": 67300,
      "end_ms": 71210,
      "text": "老的只有苏州绍兴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00023",
      "start_ms": 71210,
      "end_ms": 76075,
      "text": "城里有三座小山、釜山、杉杉塔山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00024",
      "start_ms": 76500,
      "end_ms": 81745,
      "text": "三座山并立在城里浙东古运河穿城而过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00025",
      "start_ms": 82230,
      "end_ms": 85850,
      "text": "八千多条河道六百多座桥有句老话叫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00026",
      "start_ms": 86210,
      "end_ms": 88405,
      "text": "三山万户象盘曲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00027",
      "start_ms": 88800,
      "end_ms": 91245,
      "text": "百桥、千阶水纵横。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00028",
      "start_ms": 91780,
      "end_ms": 92455,
      "text": "您想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00029",
      "start_ms": 92850,
      "end_ms": 94505,
      "text": "两千五百年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00030",
      "start_ms": 94840,
      "end_ms": 96950,
      "text": "河还是那条河桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00031",
      "start_ms": 97110,
      "end_ms": 98045,
      "text": "还是那座桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00032",
      "start_ms": 98460,
      "end_ms": 98700,
      "text": "人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00033",
      "start_ms": 98760,
      "end_ms": 100145,
      "text": "还是住在老地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00034",
      "start_ms": 100580,
      "end_ms": 102205,
      "text": "这城不是建在地上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00035",
      "start_ms": 102520,
      "end_ms": 103625,
      "text": "是长在地里的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00036",
      "start_ms": 104090,
      "end_ms": 105935,
      "text": "王羲之在这写了兰亭序。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00037",
      "start_ms": 106420,
      "end_ms": 108020,
      "text": "陆游在这儿写下死去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00038",
      "start_ms": 108080,
      "end_ms": 109015,
      "text": "元知万事空。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00039",
      "start_ms": 109610,
      "end_ms": 110975,
      "text": "鲁迅从这儿走出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00040",
      "start_ms": 111660,
      "end_ms": 116405,
      "text": "一座城把江南的骨和魂全泡在黄酒里了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00041",
      "start_ms": 117580,
      "end_ms": 118185,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00042",
      "start_ms": 118560,
      "end_ms": 124880,
      "text": "江西赣州古城在江西南部张江和共江在城下汇合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00043",
      "start_ms": 125200,
      "end_ms": 127585,
      "text": "汇成赣江三面环水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00044",
      "start_ms": 128080,
      "end_ms": 130555,
      "text": "这城有两千两百多年历史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00045",
      "start_ms": 131080,
      "end_ms": 134255,
      "text": "最绝的地方是他九百多年没被淹过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00046",
      "start_ms": 134600,
      "end_ms": 136225,
      "text": "赣州三面都是水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00047",
      "start_ms": 136850,
      "end_ms": 138935,
      "text": "北宋以前年年闹水患，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00048",
      "start_ms": 139590,
      "end_ms": 145075,
      "text": "北宋西宁年间知州刘怡修了一套地下排水系统，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00049",
      "start_ms": 145590,
      "end_ms": 149545,
      "text": "因为排水沟的走向像古篆体的福寿两个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00050",
      "start_ms": 149810,
      "end_ms": 150925,
      "text": "所以叫福寿沟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00051",
      "start_ms": 151600,
      "end_ms": 154245,
      "text": "这套沟全长十二点六公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00052",
      "start_ms": 154840,
      "end_ms": 157835,
      "text": "利用赣州西南高东北低的地势，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00053",
      "start_ms": 158350,
      "end_ms": 162190,
      "text": "用明沟暗渠和池塘连成一张网。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00054",
      "start_ms": 162350,
      "end_ms": 162970,
      "text": "水大了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00055",
      "start_ms": 162970,
      "end_ms": 164450,
      "text": "排走水小了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00056",
      "start_ms": 164450,
      "end_ms": 166965,
      "text": "存住九百多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00057",
      "start_ms": 167540,
      "end_ms": 169475,
      "text": "赣州再没被淹过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00058",
      "start_ms": 170300,
      "end_ms": 171260,
      "text": "人称不落。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00059",
      "start_ms": 171280,
      "end_ms": 173795,
      "text": "浮城您去赣州看看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00060",
      "start_ms": 174650,
      "end_ms": 183030,
      "text": "宋代城墙还在玉孤台还在辛弃疾写过玉孤台下清江水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00061",
      "start_ms": 183310,
      "end_ms": 186390,
      "text": "中间多少行人泪站在城墙上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00062",
      "start_ms": 186750,
      "end_ms": 187990,
      "text": "一边是张江，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00063",
      "start_ms": 188150,
      "end_ms": 191230,
      "text": "一边是共江两条江合在一起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00064",
      "start_ms": 191950,
      "end_ms": 196910,
      "text": "这城站在两条江中间占了两千两百多年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00065",
      "start_ms": 197370,
      "end_ms": 197990,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00066",
      "start_ms": 198370,
      "end_ms": 201770,
      "text": "湖北荆州古城在长江边上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00067",
      "start_ms": 202110,
      "end_ms": 205890,
      "text": "楚国文化的发祥地两千八百多年了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00068",
      "start_ms": 205910,
      "end_ms": 208470,
      "text": "这城最绝的是他的城墙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00069",
      "start_ms": 208870,
      "end_ms": 213870,
      "text": "荆州古城墙是中国南方保存最完整的古城墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00070",
      "start_ms": 214690,
      "end_ms": 214930,
      "text": "城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00071",
      "start_ms": 214950,
      "end_ms": 216450,
      "text": "高将近九米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00072",
      "start_ms": 217110,
      "end_ms": 218590,
      "text": "周长十一公里多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00073",
      "start_ms": 218870,
      "end_ms": 220870,
      "text": "绕城一周完整无缺。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00074",
      "start_ms": 221370,
      "end_ms": 222910,
      "text": "为什么修的这么结实？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00075",
      "start_ms": 223370,
      "end_ms": 225770,
      "text": "荆州是兵家必争之地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00076",
      "start_ms": 226090,
      "end_ms": 228430,
      "text": "关羽在这镇守过李白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00077",
      "start_ms": 228430,
      "end_ms": 231270,
      "text": "写过千里江陵一日还，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00078",
      "start_ms": 231570,
      "end_ms": 235050,
      "text": "就是这儿城墙外面是护城河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00079",
      "start_ms": 235550,
      "end_ms": 236850,
      "text": "全长一万多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00080",
      "start_ms": 236950,
      "end_ms": 238650,
      "text": "宽三十米水深，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00081",
      "start_ms": 238690,
      "end_ms": 240115,
      "text": "四米系通太湖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00082",
      "start_ms": 240200,
      "end_ms": 240365,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00083",
      "start_ms": 240670,
      "end_ms": 243245,
      "text": "东联长湖跟古运河连着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00084",
      "start_ms": 245190,
      "end_ms": 245830,
      "text": "您想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00085",
      "start_ms": 245990,
      "end_ms": 247950,
      "text": "城里有东西长三公里多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00086",
      "start_ms": 248230,
      "end_ms": 250025,
      "text": "南北宽一公里多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00087",
      "start_ms": 250470,
      "end_ms": 251930,
      "text": "四面都是城墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00088",
      "start_ms": 251930,
      "end_ms": 255325,
      "text": "围着外面一圈水围着这城怎么打？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00089",
      "start_ms": 255940,
      "end_ms": 256660,
      "text": "最绝的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00090",
      "start_ms": 256660,
      "end_ms": 257945,
      "text": "城砖上还有文字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00091",
      "start_ms": 258480,
      "end_ms": 261075,
      "text": "记录着烧砖的年代和工匠的名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00092",
      "start_ms": 261710,
      "end_ms": 266690,
      "text": "比万里长城上目前发现最早的砖还早。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00093",
      "start_ms": 266930,
      "end_ms": 269605,
      "text": "两百零七年第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00094",
      "start_ms": 269870,
      "end_ms": 272705,
      "text": "云南大理古城在苍山脚下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00095",
      "start_ms": 273150,
      "end_ms": 274115,
      "text": "洱海边上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00096",
      "start_ms": 274590,
      "end_ms": 278495,
      "text": "明洪武十五年建的一千两百多年哪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00097",
      "start_ms": 279240,
      "end_ms": 281655,
      "text": "这城最绝的是他的位置。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00098",
      "start_ms": 283080,
      "end_ms": 284040,
      "text": "东临洱海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00099",
      "start_ms": 284240,
      "end_ms": 290730,
      "text": "西镇苍山、苍山十九峰十八西溪水从山上流下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00100",
      "start_ms": 290910,
      "end_ms": 291875,
      "text": "穿过古城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00101",
      "start_ms": 292270,
      "end_ms": 300690,
      "text": "流径洱海整座城的布局是九街十八巷棋盘格局从南城门进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00102",
      "start_ms": 301150,
      "end_ms": 302490,
      "text": "抬头就能看见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00103",
      "start_ms": 302530,
      "end_ms": 305130,
      "text": "苍山回头看就是洱海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00104",
      "start_ms": 305990,
      "end_ms": 308050,
      "text": "古人把这叫风花雪月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00105",
      "start_ms": 308510,
      "end_ms": 313030,
      "text": "下观风上观花、苍山雪洱海月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00106",
      "start_ms": 313750,
      "end_ms": 316550,
      "text": "这四样东西全在这座城周围。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00107",
      "start_ms": 317070,
      "end_ms": 320150,
      "text": "古理在唐代是南赵国的都城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00108",
      "start_ms": 320670,
      "end_ms": 323160,
      "text": "宋代是大理李国的都城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00109",
      "start_ms": 323660,
      "end_ms": 327420,
      "text": "一座城做了五百多年的国都站在城墙上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00110",
      "start_ms": 327600,
      "end_ms": 328620,
      "text": "左边是苍山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00111",
      "start_ms": 328760,
      "end_ms": 329680,
      "text": "右边是洱海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00112",
      "start_ms": 330420,
      "end_ms": 334180,
      "text": "这地方不是神仙住的地方是什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00113",
      "start_ms": 335500,
      "end_ms": 340400,
      "text": "我前阵子翻到一本叫三百六十五日走遍中国的日历书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00114",
      "start_ms": 341040,
      "end_ms": 343760,
      "text": "左边一页是每个地方的实景大图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00115",
      "start_ms": 344000,
      "end_ms": 346800,
      "text": "加一段五十来个字的冷知识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00116",
      "start_ms": 347380,
      "end_ms": 349440,
      "text": "右边是日期纪事夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00117",
      "start_ms": 349720,
      "end_ms": 351685,
      "text": "什么季节去哪座小城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00118",
      "start_ms": 352120,
      "end_ms": 352860,
      "text": "走哪条路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00119",
      "start_ms": 352880,
      "end_ms": 354405,
      "text": "看什么风景最合适，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00120",
      "start_ms": 354970,
      "end_ms": 356305,
      "text": "都给你安排好了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00121",
      "start_ms": 356590,
      "end_ms": 359385,
      "text": "不是那种千篇一律的景点介绍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00122",
      "start_ms": 359690,
      "end_ms": 360915,
      "text": "是帮你挑日子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00123",
      "start_ms": 361410,
      "end_ms": 362610,
      "text": "今天翻到镇原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00124",
      "start_ms": 362770,
      "end_ms": 364090,
      "text": "明天翻到巍山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00125",
      "start_ms": 364290,
      "end_ms": 365715,
      "text": "后天翻到阆中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00126",
      "start_ms": 366060,
      "end_ms": 366945,
      "text": "翻到哪页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00127",
      "start_ms": 367210,
      "end_ms": 372595,
      "text": "就觉得那个地方在喊你我自己的习惯是每天早起翻一页当个消遣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00128",
      "start_ms": 373150,
      "end_ms": 375665,
      "text": "翻到一个从来没听说过的小地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00129",
      "start_ms": 376210,
      "end_ms": 377525,
      "text": "就去网上搜搜照片，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00130",
      "start_ms": 377930,
      "end_ms": 379225,
      "text": "搜完就想订票。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00131",
      "start_ms": 379530,
      "end_ms": 380605,
      "text": "我已经放下面了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00132",
      "start_ms": 381530,
      "end_ms": 382610,
      "text": "点开就能看到。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00133",
      "start_ms": 382830,
      "end_ms": 384570,
      "text": "喜欢到处走走的朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00134",
      "start_ms": 384570,
      "end_ms": 385730,
      "text": "弄一本放茶几，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00135",
      "start_ms": 385730,
      "end_ms": 388435,
      "text": "上一年下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00136",
      "start_ms": 388900,
      "end_ms": 390460,
      "text": "整个中国哪儿值得去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00137",
      "start_ms": 390460,
      "end_ms": 391140,
      "text": "哪个乐去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00138",
      "start_ms": 391440,
      "end_ms": 392615,
      "text": "心里全有谱了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00139",
      "start_ms": 393720,
      "end_ms": 394235,
      "text": "第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00140",
      "start_ms": 394740,
      "end_ms": 398635,
      "text": "湖北襄阳古城在汉水中游南岸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00141",
      "start_ms": 399020,
      "end_ms": 400115,
      "text": "三面环水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00142",
      "start_ms": 400420,
      "end_ms": 401235,
      "text": "一面靠山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00143",
      "start_ms": 401750,
      "end_ms": 405005,
      "text": "这座城有两千八百多年历史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00144",
      "start_ms": 405610,
      "end_ms": 408115,
      "text": "最绝的地方是他的护城河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00145",
      "start_ms": 408590,
      "end_ms": 410905,
      "text": "平均宽度一百八十米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00146",
      "start_ms": 411640,
      "end_ms": 412720,
      "text": "最宽的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00147",
      "start_ms": 412900,
      "end_ms": 413935,
      "text": "两百五十米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00148",
      "start_ms": 414370,
      "end_ms": 417425,
      "text": "相当于将近三个标准足球场连在一起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00149",
      "start_ms": 417890,
      "end_ms": 420425,
      "text": "这是中国最宽的人工护城河。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00150",
      "start_ms": 420900,
      "end_ms": 421665,
      "text": "您想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00151",
      "start_ms": 422130,
      "end_ms": 423955,
      "text": "两百多米宽的水面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00152",
      "start_ms": 424570,
      "end_ms": 427195,
      "text": "加上三面环水的天然地势，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00153",
      "start_ms": 427680,
      "end_ms": 428595,
      "text": "这城怎么打？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00154",
      "start_ms": 429290,
      "end_ms": 431965,
      "text": "历史上襄阳打过一百七十二次仗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00155",
      "start_ms": 432360,
      "end_ms": 433555,
      "text": "最出名的一次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00156",
      "start_ms": 433920,
      "end_ms": 435125,
      "text": "南宋守了六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00157",
      "start_ms": 435430,
      "end_ms": 437655,
      "text": "蒙古铁骑硬是没打下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00158",
      "start_ms": 438050,
      "end_ms": 439415,
      "text": "所以襄阳有个外号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00159",
      "start_ms": 439680,
      "end_ms": 442975,
      "text": "叫铁打的襄阳华夏第一城池，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00160",
      "start_ms": 443790,
      "end_ms": 445615,
      "text": "城墙上现在还能走人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00161",
      "start_ms": 446360,
      "end_ms": 448265,
      "text": "周长七千三百多米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00162",
      "start_ms": 448760,
      "end_ms": 450300,
      "text": "站在临汉门城楼上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00163",
      "start_ms": 450480,
      "end_ms": 451715,
      "text": "北面就是汉江。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00164",
      "start_ms": 452240,
      "end_ms": 454190,
      "text": "王维写过江流，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00165",
      "start_ms": 454250,
      "end_ms": 454950,
      "text": "天地外，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00166",
      "start_ms": 455290,
      "end_ms": 456645,
      "text": "山色有无中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00167",
      "start_ms": 457130,
      "end_ms": 460215,
      "text": "就是站在襄阳城上看到的景。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00168",
      "start_ms": 460770,
      "end_ms": 463220,
      "text": "南面是国的山西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00169",
      "start_ms": 463280,
      "end_ms": 464415,
      "text": "灭是万善，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00170",
      "start_ms": 464770,
      "end_ms": 466395,
      "text": "北面是汉江，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00171",
      "start_ms": 467240,
      "end_ms": 470300,
      "text": "东面是汉江的曲流山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00172",
      "start_ms": 470360,
      "end_ms": 471940,
      "text": "把城围住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00173",
      "start_ms": 472080,
      "end_ms": 472320,
      "text": "水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00174",
      "start_ms": 472360,
      "end_ms": 473220,
      "text": "把城抱住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00175",
      "start_ms": 474180,
      "end_ms": 477720,
      "text": "城就在山水中间两千多年来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00176",
      "start_ms": 477880,
      "end_ms": 479400,
      "text": "不管怎么改朝换代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00177",
      "start_ms": 479780,
      "end_ms": 481660,
      "text": "襄阳的山水格局没动过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00178",
      "start_ms": 482000,
      "end_ms": 484600,
      "text": "汉江还在北边流一去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00179",
      "start_ms": 484600,
      "end_ms": 489680,
      "text": "山还在南边站城还在中间一座城跟山水绑在一起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00180",
      "start_ms": 490300,
      "end_ms": 491720,
      "text": "绑了两千多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00181",
      "start_ms": 492040,
      "end_ms": 495120,
      "text": "这才是真正做头把交椅的东西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00182",
      "start_ms": 495400,
      "end_ms": 496800,
      "text": "不是城墙有多厚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00183",
      "start_ms": 497280,
      "end_ms": 500340,
      "text": "是这城跟山水长在一起了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00184",
      "start_ms": 501080,
      "end_ms": 503530,
      "text": "别的城修在山水旁边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00185",
      "start_ms": 505050,
      "end_ms": 507250,
      "text": "襄阳是长在山水里面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00186",
      "start_ms": 507630,
      "end_ms": 508810,
      "text": "您听出来了没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00187",
      "start_ms": 509650,
      "end_ms": 513830,
      "text": "这十座古城没有一座是靠楼高出名的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00188",
      "start_ms": 514730,
      "end_ms": 518270,
      "text": "绍兴靠的是山围四面水绕三方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00189",
      "start_ms": 518510,
      "end_ms": 523750,
      "text": "丽江靠的是没有城墙水穿城过徽州靠的是城套城镇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00190",
      "start_ms": 523770,
      "end_ms": 525250,
      "text": "远靠的是太极图。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00191",
      "start_ms": 525670,
      "end_ms": 528430,
      "text": "阆中靠的是沱江吊脚楼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00192",
      "start_ms": 528930,
      "end_ms": 531845,
      "text": "绍兴靠的是两千五百年不成窝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00193",
      "start_ms": 532500,
      "end_ms": 534320,
      "text": "赣州靠的是九百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00194",
      "start_ms": 534400,
      "end_ms": 535700,
      "text": "不烙荆州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00195",
      "start_ms": 535720,
      "end_ms": 538260,
      "text": "靠的是南方最完整的城墙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00196",
      "start_ms": 538940,
      "end_ms": 540900,
      "text": "大理靠的是苍山洱海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00197",
      "start_ms": 541300,
      "end_ms": 543700,
      "text": "襄阳靠的是华夏第一城池，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00198",
      "start_ms": 544480,
      "end_ms": 548680,
      "text": "每一座古城的厉害之处都不在楼有多高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00199",
      "start_ms": 549100,
      "end_ms": 551420,
      "text": "在它跟山水过了一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00200",
      "start_ms": 551720,
      "end_ms": 552620,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_305f7cf8cb28eb61_s00201",
      "start_ms": 552820,
      "end_ms": 554595,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
